207	    /**
208	     * Whether this owner is a <em>possible</em> (soft) duplicate of another owner: {@code true} when some
209	     * other owner shares this owner's last name (case-insensitively) and postcode but has a different
210	     * telephone — a near match. Always false for an owner admitted as a declared household member (via
211	     * {@code sharesHousehold}), which is not a suspected duplicate.
212	     * Computed per request, not persisted. See {@link #getPossibleDuplicateOf()} for the matched owner.
213	     */
