311	    /**
312	     * The owner's locality: the REGION segment of the {@link #getCustomerCode() customerCode}, which is
313	     * the region code derived from the postcode at creation (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099,
314	     * else {@code "UNKNOWN"}). The customer code is the single region-and-hash owner identity, so the
315	     * locality reads straight off it rather than re-deriving the region. {@code "UNKNOWN"} when no
316	     * customer code is assigned.
